    {
      "rank": 13,
      "row_id": 169401,
      "chunk_id": "0cf9750978cd_0",
      "doc_id": "0cf9750978cd",
      "text": "Returned after 1 day. :(. Returned after 1 day. I'm a tech savvy dude, love gizmos and gadgets, and was super excited to try this gimbal. At first, I fired it up with my iPhone 7 straight out of the box and it balanced beautifully! I thought all was well. But then, firmware wouldn't load on my mac. The iOS App is terribly buggy and almost non-functional in many ways. I couldn't get the gimbal to calibrate correctly. And finally, the balancing motors lost their \"level\" (20 degree slant) after about 1 hour of use, and never recovered. The gimbal acted like it couldn't support my phone after this happened, but it's well within the balancing weight limits. All efforts to calibrate and adjust to level again failed. Could never complete calibration process. Has great potential, but needs way, way more development time to work out all the kinks.",
